<title>USA: Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific Tea Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific Tea Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Great Atlantic &amp; Pacific Tea Co Inc reported results for the third quarter ended November 30:</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.37		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net		 14,091		   7,735</p>
<p> Revs		2,318,762		2,293,597</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary38,267,453	     38,220,483</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
